---
import { siteUrl } from '@/lib/site-url';
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '@/components/shared/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import ContactBand from '@/components/shared/ContactBand.astro';
import Icon from '@/components/shared/Icon.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Our Story" description="Learn about the Navratna tradition and the vision behind Navira Jewels.">
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Our Story' }]} />
  <header class="about-hero container">
    <div class="about-title"><p class="eyebrow">The Navira point of view</p><h1>Nine colours.<br /><em>One elegant whole.</em></h1></div>
    <div class="about-intro"><p class="lede">Navratna jewellery brings nine distinct stones—or nine coloured elements—into a balanced composition. Our catalogue celebrates that visual tradition through bangles designed to feel expressive, graceful, and easy to explore.</p><p class="disclaimer">This page provides cultural and styling context only. See each product page for its listed materials, sizes, and care instructions.</p></div>
  </header>

  <section class="principle-strip" aria-label="Brand principles">
    <div class="container"><span>Colour in balance</span><i>✦</i><span>Grace in motion</span><i>✦</i><span>Details with clarity</span></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section tradition" aria-labelledby="tradition-title">
    <div class="container tradition-grid">
      <div class="tradition-art" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="gem-wheel">{['#9f2034','#0f5b4c','#244c75','#e8e1d7','#a93065','#b52824','#d3b45f','#14634f','#243f75'].map((color, index) => <span style={`--stone:${color};--angle:${index * 40}deg`}><i></i></span>)}</div>
        <strong>9</strong><p>elements in harmony</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tradition-copy"><p class="eyebrow">A colourful tradition</p><h2 id="tradition-title">What makes a Navratna composition distinctive?</h2><p>The word “Navratna” refers to nine gems - ruby, pearl, red coral, emerald, yellow sapphire, diamond, blue sapphire, hessonite, and cat’s-eye. Each is associated with one of the nine celestial influences of the Navagraha, creating a colourful composition that symbolises completeness and harmony.</p><p>In Indian tradition, Navratna jewellery is regarded as auspicious and is believed to encourage balance, protection, prosperity, and positive energy.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section comparison" aria-labelledby="comparison-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading section-heading--split"><div><p class="eyebrow">Designed around real moments</p><h2 id="comparison-title">The elegance you love, with less everyday worry.</h2></div><p class="lede">For designs made from confirmed lower-cost materials, Navratna bangles can offer a colourful, captivating alternative to high-value solid-gold bangles.</p></div>
      <div class="comparison-grid">
        <article><span>01</span><h3>Gold-inspired elegance</h3><p>Designed with a rich gold-tone finish that brings the elegant look of traditional gold bangles at a more accessible price.</p></article>
        <article><span>02</span><h3>More accessible</h3><p>Where verified materials cost less than solid gold, the finished bangle can provide a more approachable way to enjoy a refined jewellery look.</p></article>
        <article><span>03</span><h3>Made for regular wear</h3><p>A potentially lighter, lower-value piece can feel easier to choose for daily routines and frequent functions. Exact weight and construction remain product-specific.</p></article>
        <article><span>04</span><h3>Lower financial exposure</h3><p>Compared with high-value gold jewellery, a lower-cost alternative may bring less financial concern if misplaced. It is not risk-free and should still be handled and stored carefully.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section philosophy">
    <div class="container philosophy-grid">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Simple by intention</p><h2>Enough detail to choose with confidence.</h2></div>
      <div class="philosophy-copy"><p>Navira Jewels is designed to make browsing calm and useful: one clear place for imagery, materials, sizes, available colours, care notes, and direct enquiries.</p><p>There is no online checkout. When a piece interests you, a call or WhatsApp conversation lets the business share the most current information personally and can help you to order as per your need.</p><a class="button button--outline" href={siteUrl('/catalogue/')}>Browse the catalogue <Icon name="arrow" /></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="container section--compact"><ContactBand /></div>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .about-hero { display: grid; align-items: end; gap: clamp(42px, 8vw, 120px); padding: clamp(52px, 8vw, 100px) 0 clamp(72px, 9vw, 118px); grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr; }
  .about-title h1 { font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 7.5vw, 7rem); }
  .about-title h1 em { color: var(--gold); font-weight: 500; }
  .about-intro .disclaimer { margin-top: 24px; padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: #887a74; font-size: .75rem; }
  .principle-strip { padding: 18px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--gold-soft); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gold-soft); background: #f7efdf; }
  .principle-strip .container { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-around; gap: 22px; color: var(--maroon); font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.35rem); font-style: italic; }
  .principle-strip i { color: var(--gold); font-size: .7rem; }
  .tradition { padding: clamp(56px, 7vw, 88px) 0 clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px); background: var(--paper); }
  .tradition-grid { display: grid; align-items: center; gap: clamp(54px, 9vw, 130px); grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr; }
  .tradition-art { position: relative; display: grid; min-height: 540px; place-items: center; overflow: hidden; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--maroon-dark); color: white; }
  .tradition-art > strong { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 10rem; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1; }
  .tradition-art > p { position: absolute; bottom: 48px; margin: 0; color: var(--gold-soft); font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .15em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .gem-wheel { position: absolute; width: 350px; height: 350px; animation: turn 40s linear infinite; }
  .gem-wheel span { position: absolute; top: calc(50% - 16px); left: calc(50% - 16px); width: 32px; height: 32px; transform: rotate(var(--angle)) translateX(170px); }
  .gem-wheel i { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 4px solid #d3ad62; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--stone); box-shadow: 0 5px 14px rgb(0 0 0 / 30%); }
  @keyframes turn { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
  @keyframes turn-mobile { from { transform: scale(.75) rotate(0deg); } to { transform: scale(.75) rotate(360deg); } }
  .tradition-copy { align-self: end; }
  .tradition-copy h2 { margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .tradition-copy p:not(.eyebrow) { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.02rem; }
  .comparison { background: var(--ivory); }
  .comparison-grid { display: grid; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-left: 1px solid var(--line); grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
  .comparison-grid article { min-height: 0; padding: 28px; border-right: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); background: rgb(255 253 249 / 60%); }
  .comparison-grid span { color: var(--gold); font-family: var(--serif); }
  .comparison-grid h3 { margin: 30px 0 12px; font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .comparison-grid p { color: var(--muted); font-size: .84rem; }
  .philosophy { background: var(--emerald); color: #e8f0ed; }
  .philosophy-grid { display: grid; gap: clamp(45px, 9vw, 130px); grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .philosophy h2 { color: white; }
  .philosophy .eyebrow { color: var(--gold-soft); }
  .philosophy-copy p { color: #cbdcd7; }
  .philosophy .button--outline { margin-top: 18px; border-color: var(--gold-soft); color: white; }
  .philosophy .button--outline:hover { border-color: var(--maroon); }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .about-hero, .tradition-grid, .philosophy-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .comparison-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .principle-strip .container { display: grid; gap: 6px 12px; text-align: center; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } .principle-strip span:first-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; } .principle-strip i { display: none; } .tradition-art { min-height: 420px; } .gem-wheel { animation-name: turn-mobile; } .comparison-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
